  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Check out my other mod that connects Applied Energistics 2 and Cooking for Blockheads-Link at the bottom-edbd7e?labelColor=154a48&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"应用烹饪宣传图\" width=\"845\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Header.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking 标题\" width=\"1425\" height=\"479\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available for-NeoForge | Fabric | Forge-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Minecraft 版本徽章\" width=\"341\" height=\"28\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install on-Client & Server-e78a4e?labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Refined Cooking 安装徽章\" width=\"240\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmeloncube.net%252fsebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"width:100%\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Promo.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking 宣传图\" width=\"1425\" height=\"211\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"width:100%\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Description.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking 简介图\" width=\"1425\" height=\"141\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">这是一个让精密存储（Refined Storage）与方块人的烹饪（Cooking for Blockheads）协同工作的模组！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">新增了两个方块（厨房工作站和厨房接入点）以及一个物品（厨房网络卡）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">厨房工作站需作为厨房网络的一部分进行放置，而厨房接入点则需放置在精密存储网络中。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">厨房工作站充当精密存储网络的接收端，需要插入一张厨房网络卡。随后，该厨房网络卡需放入厨房接入点中，后者充当精密存储网络的发射端。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">连接完成后，你将可以直接在烹饪桌上使用精密存储网络中的物品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">水和牛奶也会直接从流体存储中提取。</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"width:100%\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Recipes.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking 合成表\" width=\"1425\" height=\"650\"></p>\n<h2>方块</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>&nbsp;</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>已连接</strong></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>未连接</strong></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>厨房工作站&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/gtdxpLS/2021-11-05-00-14-59.png\" alt=\"厨房工作站（已连接）\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/MRnrBZ4/2021-11-05-00-00-52.png\" alt=\"厨房工作站（未连接）\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>厨房接入点&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/k1N7Xc0/2021-11-05-00-01-27.png\" alt=\"厨房接入点（已连接）\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\"></td>\n<td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Sm6M3MH/2021-11-04-23-58-08.png\" alt=\"厨房接入点（未连接）\" width=\"400\" height=\"231\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>集成支持</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模组可独立运行。下方列出的可选模组支持情况取决于 Minecraft 版本。游戏内指南为帕秋莉手册（Patchouli Book），因此需要安装帕秋莉模组方可阅读。</span></p>\n<table style=\"width:100%\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Minecraft</strong></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>加载器</strong></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>JEI</strong></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>REI</strong></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>EMI</strong></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Jade</strong></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>The One Probe</strong></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Patchouli</strong></span></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.18.x, 1.19.x, 1.20.1</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">否</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">否</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">否</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.20.4</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">NeoForge</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">1.21.1</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">NeoForge, Fabric</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是（仅限 NeoForge）</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">26.1.2</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">NeoForge, Fabric</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">否</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">否</span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">是</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在 1.21.1 版本中，The One Probe 仅支持 NeoForge，因为它没有 Fabric 版本。在 Fabric 上，Jade 可提供相同的游戏内信息提示。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_Screenshot.png\" alt=\"Refined Cooking 游戏截图\" width=\"1808\" height=\"824\"></p>\n<h2>社交媒体</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/itssebastrn/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=ItsSebastrn&color=e78a4e&labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Curseforge\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fItsSebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=@ItsSebastrn&color=e78a4e&labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Twitter\" width=\"159\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC46TYUp8WpcFub8NxuGA66A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Sebastrn&color=e78a4e&labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Youtube\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/itssebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=ItsSebastrn&color=e78a4e&labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge&logo=twitch&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Twitch\" width=\"148\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Sebastrn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Sebastrn&color=e78a4e&labelColor=7f1620&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Sebastrn 的 Github\" width=\"125\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applied-cooking\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Refined_Cooking/BH_RC_ACLink.png\" alt=\"应用烹饪宣传图\" width=\"1808\" height=\"268\"></a></p>",
